From: EasyStick <noreply@easystick.local>
Subject: [PATCH] easystick: 0023-A2 H2C TCP/22 signature observe

Observe-only. Keep NG-1.0.6.0.1. No WIFI_PS_NONE, no TX retry, no
send_task notify. TCP sport=22 plen>0 only; unique sig64 table +
aggregates via slave shared-register bytes 32..63 (ABI v3 0x0B23).
